rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">112</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">87<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">gpu</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">25,809</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">13,166</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">522.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">9,773</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">388.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,249</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">168.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">20,696</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">344.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">15,875</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">264.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">8,324</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">138.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">321w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">This is the XIKII Industrial FF04, an ultra-expensive niche case sold on XIKII website, AliExpress, and Taobao ($599 US + $130 shipping from XIKII). The case is built exclusively around the ASUS ProArt GPU and ASUS ROG Loki SFX-L PSUs, making it a specialized showpiece rather than an everyday computer. The case features impressive CNC-machined black power-coated aluminum from a single block (7.5kg unloaded, 10.5kg fully loaded). Installation requires removing wooden box with metal tabs and following a specific component order. CPU cooling achieved reasonable temps using ID-Cooling IS-50x v3 with Arctic P12 ARGB fan instead of recommended IS-67; during stress testing the 7800x3d hit 95C but stayed under 65C during gaming. GPU cooling is excellent (under 70C even under stress) due to open-air environment, though requires dusting every couple weeks. Major trade-offs include love-hate cable management cleanliness versus IO accessibility (both motherboard and GPU IO face downward). Channels cut into aluminum blocks effectively route PSU intake and GPU exhaust. Tolerances are incredibly precise (0.25-0.50mm gaps). The builder chose high-tier components matching the case&#x27;s premium positioning: Ryzen 7 7800x3d, ASUS ROG Strix B650E-I, ASUS ProArt 4080 SUPER, and 32GB DDR5 6000 MHz. This is ultimately a collector&#x27;s piece and work of art for hardcore enthusiasts with disposable income—aesthetic dream backed by serious performance that will remain beautiful and functional for years. Not for daily drivers or those seeking GPU/PSU upgradability. XIKII has also released FF04 LP in vertical ($520) and horizontal ($480) orientations with different component compatibility.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">17,408</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:58%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->42<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">200.1</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">4<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">522.7<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-green\" style=\"width:89%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->11<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.63</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">15<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-10\"><div class=\"max-w-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm\">ComponentWatch</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real-time PC component price tracking and community-verified SFF build data.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-14 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Prices</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted