igh-tier components matching the case's premium positioning: Ryzen 7 7800x3d, ASUS ROG Strix B650E-I, ASUS ProArt 4080 SUPER, and 32GB DDR5 6000 MHz. This is ultimately a collector's piece and work of art for hardcore enthusiasts with disposable income—aesthetic dream backed by serious performance that will remain beautiful and functional for years. Not for daily drivers or those seeking GPU/PSU upgradability. XIKII has also released FF04 LP in vertical ($520) and horizontal ($480) orientations with different component compatibility.17:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\",\"children\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"$20\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"17,408\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"58%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\",\"children\":[\"top \",42,\"%\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",nu